# mutgap4_sys_iosfc_v1_after_host_only: A v1 descriptor maps a surface over guest pages whatever the v2 descriptor mapped before it was: the upgrade to the v2 form clears hostOnly. v2 descriptors: eight host-only 16x8 surfaces mapped (and their descriptor copies freed), then the enable written 0 and the table again (v1), and a v1 16x8 surface over a data page, mapped then tested: the test writes its pattern into the data page. Measured: without that clear the map does the same (the freed copy never hands its hostOnly bit to the next map on this host).
